The '''Leader of the Socialist Party of Burawa''' is the highest-ranking position within the [[Socialist Party of Burawa]], responsible for setting party policy, representing the party in public, and serving as the party's candidate for [[Leader of the Burawi Republic]] in leadership elections.

The position is filled by vote of the party congress, which convenes to elect party leadership following a vacancy or scheduled leadership review.

The Socialist Party held the [[Leadership of the Burawi Republic]] continuously from 1990 to 2015, and the party leader simultaneously served as national Leader during this period.

